{"scene_id": "s01424", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01424.fountain", "heading": "EXT. FROZEN RESERVOIR - DAWN", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "ODALYS MERCADO", "names": ["ODALYS MERCADO", "ODALYS"], "gender": "f", "first": 4, "spoke": 6}, {"id": 1, "name": "HANS-PETER VOSS", "names": ["HANS-PETER VOSS", "HANS-PETER"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 6}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. FROZEN RESERVOIR - DAWN", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "The lake lies like a sheet of poured pewter, its far shore dissolved in mist.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Snow has drifted in long tongues over the ice.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "It is entirely silent, the kind of silence with weight.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "ODALYS MERCADO (30s, orange parka, a camera strapped across her chest) walks a careful line over the surface, testing each step with an ice pick.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind her, HANS-PETER VOSS (60s, tall, beard grey with frost, a rucksack twice the size it should be) drags a sled loaded with coiled rope and a sealed metal case.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Look at it. Not a crack.", "name": "ODALYS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ice does not announce itself.", "name": "HANS-PETER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're a cheerful man.", "name": "ODALYS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am a careful man.", "name": "HANS-PETER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "They walk on.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "A pale sun clears the ridge and lays copper across the ice.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Ahead, a red flag on a bamboo pole marks the survey stake.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Odalys quickens.", "para": 2, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Hans-Peter keeps the sled's rope short, and slow.", "para": 2, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "She reaches the stake.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Photographs it.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Photographs the horizon.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Laughs at nothing in particular, breath smoking.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We did it. Day four, and the ice is solid, and --", "name": "ODALYS", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Under their boots, a long groan rolls out from the center of the lake, a bass note that climbs through the soles of the feet into the teeth.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Both freeze.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Odalys's smile hangs on her face a second longer than it should.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do not run.", "name": "HANS-PETER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["low"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I wasn't going to.", "name": "ODALYS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your face says you were.", "name": "HANS-PETER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "A black line spiders from beneath the sled runner, racing in two directions.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Hans-Peter releases the rope.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Odalys drops flat, spreading her arms.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "The sled tilts.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "The metal case slides, slides, tips, and vanishes into a widening mouth of water without a splash.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "They lie side by side, a body's length apart, hands spread on the ice like swimmers on a cold floor.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That was the samples.", "name": "ODALYS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That was a case.", "name": "HANS-PETER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "They crawl.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Slowly.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "The line widens behind them, then stops.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "The groan fades.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Somewhere far off, a raven calls.", "para": 7, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Hans-Peter reaches the thick white of the shore snow first, pulls himself onto it, and offers a gloved hand back.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Odalys takes it.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Pulls up.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Both scramble backward from the edge and sit, panting.", "para": 8, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Day four.", "name": "ODALYS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Day four.", "name": "HANS-PETER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}]}